DESCRIPTION:To celebrate the opening of Confluence: The Tina Freeman Colle
 ction of Photographs \, join NOMA and PhotoNOLA for a gallery talk\, an in
 tergenerational conversation about the exhibition and career experiences i
 n the field of photography\, as well as a book signing. Panelists for the 
 discussion “The Work We Live With: Women in Photography” include photo
 grapher\, curator\, and collector Tina Freeman\; photographer and filmmake
 r Sienna Pinderhughes\; and photographer and founder of Women Photograph D
 aniella Zalcman. The conversation will be moderated by Emilia Mickevicius
 \, Norton Family Assistant Curator of Photography at the Center for Creati
 ve Photography at the University of Arizona and contributin\nCategory: Spe
