DESCRIPTION:Dominick Pupa\, nightclub sensation and cohost of the hit podc
 ast FixingFamousPeople\, returns to Punchline with Dom We Now Our Gay Appa
 rel. TimeOutNY calls his acclaimed annual skewering of the year that was\,
  “One of the 50 Best Things to do at Christmas.” It’s a pop culture 
 roasting with holiday music parodies that will ruin the Christmas classics
  for you forever. Jokes\, songs\, one elf\, no shelf.\nCategory: Music\nOr
 iginal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/dom-we-now-our-gay-apparel/
